Pisahkan utilitas *reusable* ke header dengan *include guard*.

**Hindari di `loop()`:**
```cpp
String s = "temp=" + String(val) + " C"; // alokasi heap berulang!
```

**Gunakan buffer statis + `snprintf()`:**
```cpp
char buf[64];
snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "temp=%.2f C", val);
Serial.println(buf);
```

`millis()` kembali ke `0` (*rollover*) setiap $2^{32}\text{ ms} \approx 49{,}71\text{ hari}$.

**Pola aman (unsigned subtraction):**
```cpp
if ((uint32_t)(nowMs - prevMs) >= intervalMs) {
  prevMs = nowMs;
  // aksi periodik
}
```

Ganti tumpukan `flag` boolean membingungkan dengan **state eksklusif**:

```cpp
enum class SystemState : uint8_t { IDLE, SAMPLE, ALERT };

switch (currentState) {
  case SystemState::IDLE:   /* cek timer */ break;
  case SystemState::SAMPLE: /* baca & evaluasi */ break;
  case SystemState::ALERT:  /* kedip cepat & cek timer */ break;
}
```
